{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Centamo 是一款注重私隱的開支追蹤工具，適合想快速記錄消費、瞭解每月支出與訂閱成本的 iPhone 使用者。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-262.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>快速記錄開支與訂閱</h2>\n<p>輸入金額後點選常用分類即可完成記帳，並可加入備註、標籤或收據；相機掃描收據後由 iPhone 辨識文字並建議金額、日期與商戶，確認後才入帳。固定支出與訂閱會按到期日自動計算，亦可查看月結、分類佔比、年度變化及匯出 CSV 或 PDF 報告。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-329-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-330-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-331-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-332-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-333-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-334-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Centamo: Spending Tracker</li><li>應用類別：Finance</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/centamo-spending-tracker/id6824056121?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T23:24:17.357376+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":269,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T22:59:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T14:17:35.126688+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T23:17:46.378207+00:00","content_hash":"f92eebd2d82e1fc607ef095b0af151e9e64ae07e5e0132353535ea6c6cfc5ed5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}